WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.367 --> 00:00:03.836
-Welcome, everybody.
Welcome, welcome, welcome.

00:00:03.836 --> 00:00:06.072
[ Chuckles ] Wow.

00:00:06.072 --> 00:00:08.341
Looking great.
Please, enjoy. Relax.

00:00:08.341 --> 00:00:09.475
Welcome, everybody.

00:00:09.475 --> 00:00:12.278
Welcome to
"The Tonight Show," everybody.

00:00:12.278 --> 00:00:14.314
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:16.582 --> 00:00:18.718
It is a -- It's a special night

00:00:18.718 --> 00:00:20.987
because, for the first time
since the pandemic,

00:00:20.987 --> 00:00:23.723
our audience is no longer
required to wear a mask.

00:00:23.723 --> 00:00:25.425
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:25.425 --> 00:00:28.694 line:0%
♪♪

00:00:28.694 --> 00:00:30.830
Smile!
Smile!

00:00:30.830 --> 00:00:32.766
You're on TV.

00:00:32.766 --> 00:00:34.033
Yeah.

00:00:34.033 --> 00:00:36.402
So, you better laugh
'cause I can see who isn't.

00:00:36.402 --> 00:00:38.538
[ Laughter ]

00:00:38.538 --> 00:00:40.005
What an exciting time this is.

00:00:40.005 --> 00:00:42.175
We're maskless,
fully vaccinated,

00:00:42.175 --> 00:00:43.843
and it's officially summer.

00:00:43.843 --> 00:00:44.844
Official.
-Yeah.

00:00:44.844 --> 00:00:47.013
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:47.013 --> 00:00:49.148
It's great.

00:00:49.148 --> 00:00:51.484
That's right. Kids are pumped
that school is over

00:00:51.484 --> 00:00:54.053
while their parents are staring
blankly at a wall like,

00:00:54.053 --> 00:00:56.923
"I thought we had more time."
[ Laughter ]

00:00:56.923 --> 00:00:58.791
Yeah, and it's not just the
start of summer, you guys.

00:00:58.791 --> 00:01:01.561 line:0%
It's also Amazon Prime Day.
-Hey!

00:01:01.561 --> 00:01:03.629 line:0%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:03.629 --> 00:01:05.765
That's right.
That's right.

00:01:05.765 --> 00:01:07.633
Today, instead of buying stuff
we don't need,

00:01:07.633 --> 00:01:10.403
we buy stuff we don't need
at a slightly lower price.

00:01:10.403 --> 00:01:11.537
[ Laughter ]

00:01:11.537 --> 00:01:12.805
I don't know what
an immersion blender is,

00:01:12.805 --> 00:01:15.775
but, yeah, just look at
the price on that.

00:01:15.775 --> 00:01:17.009
How am I gonna make my coffee

00:01:17.009 --> 00:01:18.311
if I don't have
an immersion blender?

00:01:18.311 --> 00:01:19.712
[ Laughter ]

00:01:19.712 --> 00:01:22.415
Prime Day
is actually a two-day event.

00:01:22.415 --> 00:01:24.149
-Ooh.
-Yeah, Amazon is basically

00:01:24.149 --> 00:01:26.619
your annoying friend
who plans a "birthday weekend."

00:01:26.619 --> 00:01:30.089
[ Laughter ]
"You only get one day, Carl."

00:01:30.089 --> 00:01:32.658
Yep, Amazon has deals
on outdoor cameras,

00:01:32.658 --> 00:01:36.663
digital recorders,
and night-vision binoculars.

00:01:36.663 --> 00:01:38.464
And with that much
spying capability,

00:01:38.464 --> 00:01:41.367
you're basically Amazon.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:41.367 --> 00:01:43.970
You're at least Facebook.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:43.970 --> 00:01:46.472
Some news from Washington.
This weekend, Kim Jong-un

00:01:46.472 --> 00:01:49.476
made his first statement about
the Biden administration,

00:01:49.476 --> 00:01:53.446 line:0%
saying that he's prepared for
both dialogue and confrontation.

00:01:53.446 --> 00:01:55.548 line:0%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:55.548 --> 00:01:57.183
That's right.
Kim Jong-un just challenged

00:01:57.183 --> 00:02:00.820
Biden to a rap battle.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:00.820 --> 00:02:03.289
Yep, Kim Jong-un says that he's
prepared for both dialogue

00:02:03.289 --> 00:02:05.925
and confrontation.
It's the same thing my aunt says

00:02:05.925 --> 00:02:07.961
when she walks into a T.J. Maxx.

00:02:07.961 --> 00:02:09.963
[ Laughter ]

00:02:09.963 --> 00:02:12.532
"Let's go!"

00:02:12.532 --> 00:02:14.634
Well, guys, the Olympics
are almost here, and today,

00:02:14.634 --> 00:02:19.005 line:0%
organizers announced that venues
will be at 50% capacity.

00:02:19.005 --> 00:02:23.776
-Oh.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:23.776 --> 00:02:26.378
-That's right. 50%,
which means only four people

00:02:26.378 --> 00:02:28.881
will be allowed to watch fencing
instead of the normal eight.

00:02:28.881 --> 00:02:31.450
[ Laughter ]

00:02:31.450 --> 00:02:33.586
En garde!
-Chh!

00:02:33.586 --> 00:02:34.820
-Do they start
with the hand up here?

00:02:34.820 --> 00:02:37.490
-Sure. Why not?

00:02:37.490 --> 00:02:38.824
Yeah.
-Eventually -- I've seen this.

00:02:38.824 --> 00:02:40.526
-Eventually, it's épée.
-But does it start --

00:02:40.526 --> 00:02:42.628
Like this, maybe?
-Yeah, maybe that.

00:02:42.628 --> 00:02:44.330
Maybe that.
That looks good.

00:02:44.330 --> 00:02:46.398
You look good like that.
-I look like a fencer there.

00:02:46.398 --> 00:02:47.866
-Yeah, a fencer
of stolen jewelry.

00:02:47.866 --> 00:02:50.370
-Just being cocky.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:50.370 --> 00:02:51.871
-You got to put a pinky out
on the sword.

00:02:51.871 --> 00:02:54.106
-Yeah, I throw the pinky out.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:54.106 --> 00:02:55.374
-You know, class.
There you go.

00:02:55.374 --> 00:02:56.708
-Class it up a little bit.
-Pure class.

00:02:56.708 --> 00:02:59.012
-Pinky out on the sword.
Like that?

00:02:59.012 --> 00:03:00.913
Maybe like that?
-Yeah, like a flourish.

00:03:00.913 --> 00:03:03.249
-Like a flour--
-Like jazz hands.

00:03:03.249 --> 00:03:04.383
Yeah, there you go.
There you go.

00:03:04.383 --> 00:03:05.451
-This is how you fence?
-Yeah.

00:03:05.451 --> 00:03:07.053 line:0%
♪♪

00:03:07.053 --> 00:03:08.821
-That's how you fence?
-Yeah.

00:03:08.821 --> 00:03:10.689
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:10.689 --> 00:03:14.259
En garde!
Touché!

00:03:14.259 --> 00:03:17.830
-Also, they also said fans
aren't allowed to cheer.

00:03:17.830 --> 00:03:20.433
-Oh.
[ Light laughter ]

00:03:20.433 --> 00:03:22.502
-Although they say that at the
beginning of every graduation,

00:03:22.502 --> 00:03:25.204
and parents are still like,
"Thomas, yeah!

00:03:25.204 --> 00:03:27.173
Whoo!
Tommy, you did it!

00:03:27.173 --> 00:03:30.543
That's my boy, Tommy!"
[ Laughter ]

00:03:30.543 --> 00:03:33.279
Soccer superstar
Cristiano Ronaldo just became

00:03:33.279 --> 00:03:37.050
