are reaching out

00:03:42.187 --> 00:03:44.990
to congratulate him.
For example, Lionel Messi said,

00:03:44.990 --> 00:03:47.060
"What an incredible achievement.
Way to go!"

00:03:47.060 --> 00:03:48.260
[ Laughter ]

00:03:48.260 --> 00:03:49.896
