It didn't stop there.

00:04:00.105 --> 00:04:02.742
Remember that statue of him?
-I knew it.

00:04:02.742 --> 00:04:05.111
I knew it.
-Oh, no, it didn't --

00:04:05.111 --> 00:04:08.080
-The bronze statue of Ronaldo
reached out and said...

00:04:08.080 --> 00:04:09.415
