00:04:09.415 --> 00:04:11.217
-"Ermagherd, yer nermber wern!"

00:04:11.217 --> 00:04:15.254
[ Laughter ]

00:04:15.254 --> 00:04:18.291
-Oh, no.
-After that, Ariana Grande said,

00:04:18.291 --> 00:04:20.827
"I hope I can get
to 300 million soon."

00:04:20.827 --> 00:04:23.595
And the statue of Ronaldo
was like, "Mer ter!

00:04:23.595 --> 00:04:25.832
Er werna ber perpyerler!"

00:04:25.832 --> 00:04:28.101
[ Laughter ]

00:04:28.101 --> 00:04:29.902
Wants to be "perpular."
-"Perpular"?

00:04:29.902 --> 00:04:31.904
-Then this plaque
of Elvis Presley spoke up

00:04:31.904 --> 00:04:36.075
and said, "Yerr! Plers ferler
mer ern Ernstagrerm."

00:04:36.075 --> 00:04:37.776
[ Laughter ]

00:04:37.776 --> 00:04:40.579
And finally this statue
of Lucille Ball said,

00:04:40.579 --> 00:04:43.549
"Mer herndle ers
@rerl-lercerlle-berl.

00:04:43.549 --> 00:04:47.352
#Ferlerberk.
#Ernflererncer."

00:04:47.352 --> 00:04:49.421
[ Cheers and applause ]
They're all very excited.

00:04:49.421 --> 00:04:52.257
Good for him.
300 million is

00:04:52.257 --> 00:04:54.359
nothing to sneeze at.

00:04:54.359 --> 00:04:56.495
Listen to this.
I saw that NASA is struggling

00:04:56.495 --> 00:04:59.565
to fix a computer on
the Hubble Space Telescope

00:04:59.565 --> 00:05:02.935
that was developed in the 1980s.
Yeah.

00:05:02.935 --> 00:05:04.770
It's from the '80s,
so the manual only says,

00:05:04.770 --> 00:05:06.773
"Remove the circuit board
and blow on it."

00:05:06.773 --> 00:05:10.443
[ Laughter ]

00:05:10.443 --> 00:05:13.379
And finally, a grocery store in
Wisconsin is offering customers

00:05:13.379 --> 00:05:15.414
color-coded bracelets to show

00:05:15.414 --> 00:05:19.318 line:0%
their social-distancing
comfort levels.

00:05:19.318 --> 00:05:22.722
Yeah, red means no contact.
Yellow means elbows only.

00:05:22.722 --> 00:05:24.590
And green means open-mouth kiss.
-Oh.

00:05:24.590 --> 00:05:25.658
[ Laughter ]

00:05:25.658 --> 00:05:26.826
Let's get to some news.

00:05:26.826 --> 00:05:29.095
It just came out
that Trump's former bodyguard

00:05:29.095 --> 00:05:31.831 line:0%
