00:05:38.070 --> 00:05:40.573
The guy's name
is Matthew Calamari.

00:05:40.573 --> 00:05:42.508
[ Laughter ]

00:05:46.579 --> 00:05:48.781
Can we take a look
at Matthew Calamari?

00:05:48.781 --> 00:05:51.083
-Yep.
-Yeah.

00:05:51.083 --> 00:05:53.252
[ Laughter ]
-Yeah.

00:05:53.252 --> 00:05:56.088
-Come on. His name
had to be Matthew Calamari.

00:05:56.088 --> 00:05:58.291
Looks like a bouncer
at Olive Garden.

00:05:58.291 --> 00:06:00.860
[ Laughter ]

00:06:00.860 --> 00:06:02.628
No word yet on Trump's
other bodyguards,

00:06:02.628 --> 00:06:04.930
Johnny Meatballs,
Vinnie Calzone,

00:06:04.930 --> 00:06:07.333
and Sammy Shrimp Scampi.

00:06:07.333 --> 00:06:09.702
-Hey! Oh!

00:06:09.702 --> 00:06:12.105
-Sammy Shrimp Scampi.
That's very good.

00:06:12.105 --> 00:06:14.006
Well, guys, the White House says

00:06:14.006 --> 00:06:16.409
that the country will need
a few extra weeks to hit

00:06:16.409 --> 00:06:21.380 line:0%
