00:06:32.892 --> 00:06:35.395
That was beautiful.
That's the finale.

00:06:36.862 --> 00:06:39.465
I think that's the finale now."

00:06:39.465 --> 00:06:40.933
"No, no, no. Just wait."

00:06:40.933 --> 00:06:43.002
"No, no, I know. That's it.

00:06:43.002 --> 00:06:46.204
Wait, wait, wait.
That's the final--

00:06:46.204 --> 00:06:47.773
It was Matthew Calamari."

00:06:47.773 --> 00:06:49.408
[ Light laughter ]

00:06:49.408 --> 00:06:54.313
According to projections, it
will be around 68% by July 4th.

00:06:54.313 --> 00:06:56.415
Don't worry, though. Today --

00:06:56.415 --> 00:06:58.651
