to be seen in public.

00:11:17.743 --> 00:11:20.178
In fact, some of them are
even using body doubles.

00:11:20.178 --> 00:11:24.616
For example, Senator Ben Sasse
is using his body double,

00:11:24.616 --> 00:11:27.919
SpongeBob.
[ Laughter ]

00:11:27.919 --> 00:11:30.723
I mean, it's getting
that serious.

00:11:30.723 --> 00:11:32.925
Next up,
here's Senator Roy Blunt.

00:11:32.925 --> 00:11:35.261
His body double is
Jack Nicholson's Joker.

00:11:35.261 --> 00:11:37.663
[ Laughter ]

00:11:37.663 --> 00:11:38.697
He doesn't want
to be seen in public.

00:11:38.697 --> 00:11:41.833
-Wow. That's crazy.

00:11:41.833 --> 00:11:45.004
-Senator Roger Marshall
is using his body double,

00:11:45.004 --> 00:11:50.275
a pack of Chiclets.
[ Laughter ]

00:11:50.275 --> 00:11:52.344
I mean, they don't want to be --
-They don't want to be seen.

00:11:52.344 --> 00:11:54.780
-Senator Rick Scott
is using his body double,

00:11:54.780 --> 00:11:57.649
a human thumb.
[ Laughter ]

00:11:57.649 --> 00:12:01.520
Just walking around.
-Wow. Oh, my gosh.

00:12:01.520 --> 00:12:03.788
-Finally, of course,
Mitch McConnell

00:12:03.788 --> 00:12:06.224
is using his body double,

00:12:06.224 --> 00:12:08.527
Toby Turtle.
[ Laughter ]

00:12:08.527 --> 00:12:10.028
It's just -- just to be safe.

00:12:10.028 --> 00:12:14.032
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:12:14.032 --> 00:12:15.067
Well, listen to this.

00:12:15.067 --> 00:12:17.402
I read that Ivanka Trump
and Jared Kushner

00:12:17.402 --> 00:12:19.037
