losing the election.

00:12:24.843 --> 00:12:26.745
When he heard that one of
his kids wanted distance,

00:12:26.745 --> 00:12:28.948
Trump was like, "Please be Eric,
please be Eric."

00:12:28.948 --> 00:12:31.450
[ Laughter ]

00:12:31.450 --> 00:12:33.452
Well, this is fun.
During his weekly address,

00:12:33.452 --> 00:12:36.388
