00:12:41.327 --> 00:12:44.997 line:0%
[ Laughter ]

00:12:44.997 --> 00:12:46.665
Spider-Man.

00:12:46.665 --> 00:12:48.834
[ Laughter ]

00:12:48.834 --> 00:12:51.036
Vatican security was like,
"Hey, I know we said everyone

00:12:51.036 --> 00:12:53.372
should wear a mask, but this is
taking it to a whole new level."

00:12:53.372 --> 00:12:54.473
[ Laughter ]

00:12:54.473 --> 00:12:56.308
Yeah, the visit ended
when Spider-Man

00:12:56.308 --> 00:12:57.876
kissed the Pope's ring
upside down.

00:12:57.876 --> 00:12:59.111
-Oh.
-Kind of awesome.

00:12:59.111 --> 00:13:01.513
[ Laughter ]

00:13:01.513 --> 00:13:04.183
Well, Tinder rolled out
a new feature yesterday called

00:13:04.183 --> 00:13:08.120
"Hot Takes," which lets singles
chat before matching.

00:13:08.120 --> 00:13:10.255
And this is cool.
As an added bonus,

00:13:10.255 --> 00:13:12.158
