with a list of things

00:13:12.158 --> 00:13:15.261
that you should avoid saying
during this introductory chat.

00:13:15.261 --> 00:13:16.428
[ Laughter ]

00:13:16.428 --> 00:13:18.097
For instance, things such as,

00:13:18.097 --> 00:13:20.366
"Only three more days until
this ankle monitor comes off."

00:13:20.366 --> 00:13:21.833
[ Laughter ]

00:13:21.833 --> 00:13:23.035
Don't say that.
-Don't say it.

00:13:23.035 --> 00:13:24.702
-Don't start with it,
at least, yeah.

00:13:24.702 --> 00:13:26.004
Or how about this one?

00:13:26.004 --> 00:13:28.073
"What do you know about
starting insurance fires?"

00:13:28.073 --> 00:13:30.142
[ Laughter ]

00:13:30.142 --> 00:13:32.310
-It's called Tinder.
-Yeah.

00:13:32.310 --> 00:13:34.279
And finally, this one here,
"It's crazy,

00:13:34.279 --> 00:13:36.415
but this is the only dating app
that hasn't banned me."

00:13:36.415 --> 00:13:38.550
You shouldn't say those things
to open up.

00:13:38.550 --> 00:13:42.320
[ Applause ]
Give it a little time.

00:13:42.320 --> 00:13:45.858
Some more business news -- I saw
that budget airline Frontier

00:13:45.858 --> 00:13:48.327
recently added
a COVID recovery charge

00:13:48.327 --> 00:13:52.097
