00:13:52.097 --> 00:13:54.466
$1.59 might not
sound like a lot,

00:13:54.466 --> 00:13:56.435
but on Frontier,
that's a round trip to Orlando.

00:13:56.435 --> 00:13:58.436
[ Laughter ]

00:13:58.436 --> 00:14:01.073
And finally, Sam Adams
is offering to pay

00:14:01.073 --> 00:14:04.944 line:0%
$10,000 wedding bar tab
for couples who include

00:14:04.944 --> 00:14:07.813 line:0%
Sam Adams summer ale
in their wedding vows.

00:14:07.813 --> 00:14:09.214 line:0%
[ Laughter ]

00:14:09.214 --> 00:14:10.582
This is great.

00:14:10.582 --> 00:14:12.717
Half the grooms in Boston
already planned on saying it,

00:14:12.717 --> 00:14:15.887
but now they might get paid.
[ Laughter ]

00:14:15.887 --> 00:14:19.090
Not to be outdone, you can also
win 10% off the cocktail hour

00:14:19.090 --> 00:14:22.760
