National pigs in a blanket."

00:14:22.760 --> 00:14:24.062
This is very exciting.

00:14:24.062 --> 00:14:27.432
Today, New York ended its
pandemic state of emergency.

00:14:27.432 --> 00:14:28.901
It's over.

00:14:28.901 --> 00:14:30.803
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:14:32.204 --> 00:14:33.905
But, unfortunately,
that also means

00:14:33.905 --> 00:14:36.007 line:0%
