00:14:36.007 --> 00:14:38.409 line:0%
[ Audience boos ]

00:14:38.409 --> 00:14:39.844
...marking the first time

00:14:39.844 --> 00:14:41.913
anyone's been nostalgic
for 2020.

00:14:41.913 --> 00:14:43.749
It's too bad.

00:14:43.749 --> 00:14:45.417
I'm really gonna miss
seeing delivery guys

00:14:45.417 --> 00:14:47.853
balance yardstick margaritas
on their E-bikes.

00:14:47.853 --> 00:14:49.788
Whoa-a-a-a.

00:14:49.788 --> 00:14:51.924
Speaking of New York, the state

00:14:51.924 --> 00:14:55.294
just suspended Rudy Giuliani
from practicing law

00:14:55.294 --> 00:14:56.461
'cause of...

00:14:56.461 --> 00:14:59.198
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:15:00.666 --> 00:15:03.535 line:0%
...'cause of his repeated false
and misleading statements

00:15:03.535 --> 00:15:05.403 line:0%
about the election.

00:15:05.403 --> 00:15:08.474
Even Rudy was like, "What
the hell took you so long?"

00:15:08.474 --> 00:15:11.276
You know you've crossed a line
when other lawyers are like,

00:15:11.276 --> 00:15:13.445
"This guy lies way too much."

00:15:13.445 --> 00:15:15.447
It's a mixed bag for Rudy.

00:15:15.447 --> 00:15:17.416
The bad news -- he can't
practice law in New York.

00:15:17.416 --> 00:15:20.052
The good news -- he can't defend
himself at his next trial.

00:15:21.887 --> 00:15:23.722
Meanwhile, when the news
about Rudy broke,

00:15:23.722 --> 00:15:26.392
