released a video statement.

00:15:26.392 --> 00:15:27.859
Watch this.

00:15:27.859 --> 00:15:31.096
-As you may have heard recently,
a few minutes ago,

00:15:31.096 --> 00:15:33.865
my father's law license
was suspended

00:15:33.865 --> 00:15:35.334
by the New York state

00:15:35.334 --> 00:15:38.036
First Appellate Division
of the Supreme Court.

00:15:38.036 --> 00:15:42.041
This is unacceptable,
and I stand by my father.

00:15:43.308 --> 00:15:45.444 line:0%
[ Laughter ]

00:15:45.444 --> 00:15:47.713 line:0%
[ Applause ]

00:15:49.514 --> 00:15:51.884 line:0%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:15:55.587 --> 00:15:58.723 line:0%
[ Laughter ]

00:15:58.723 --> 00:16:02.261 line:0%
-The top 20% of his body
stands with his father.

00:16:03.896 --> 00:16:06.698
What did he use to film that?
A truck's rear-view camera?

00:16:06.698 --> 00:16:08.700
Like, "Just put it in reverse
and hit 'record.'

00:16:08.700 --> 00:16:11.236
Hey, I'll lay on the ground."

00:16:11.236 --> 00:16:12.804
-[ Imitating backup signal ]

00:16:12.804 --> 00:16:15.707
-Rudy saw his son giving
a speech in a random parking lot

00:16:15.707 --> 00:16:17.643
and was like,
"I've taught him so well."

00:16:17.643 --> 00:16:19.577
[ Laughter ]

00:16:19.577 --> 00:16:20.646
Some more legal news.

00:16:20.646 --> 00:16:22.481
A 49-year-old woman from Indiana

00:16:22.481 --> 00:16:24.816
